## Common Issues & Solutions

### Code Quality & Formatting

| Situation | Action | Make Command |
|-----------|--------|--------------|
| Ruff linting errors | Check and fix linting issues | `make lint` |
| Code formatting needed | Auto-format code with ruff | `make format` |
| Type checking errors | Run mypy type checker | `make type-check` |
| Pre-commit checks | Run all quality checks | `make lint && make type-check` |

**Workflow:**
```bash
# After making changes, run:
make format      # Auto-fix formatting
make lint        # Check for remaining issues
make type-check  # Verify types
```

### Testing Issues

| Situation | Action | Make Command |
|-----------|--------|--------------|
| Unit tests failing | Run tests with verbose output | `make test` |
| Integration tests failing | Run integration suite | `make test-integration` |
| Test database not running | Start test database | `make test-db-up` |
| Test database needs migration | Migrate test database | `make test-db-migrate` |
| Test database cleanup | Stop test database | `make test-db-down` |

**Debugging Tests:**
```bash
# Run specific test file
pytest tests/path/to/test_file.py -v

# Run with debug output
pytest tests/ -v -s

# Run single test
pytest tests/path/to/test_file.py::test_function -v
```

### Database Issues

| Situation | Action | Make Command |
|-----------|--------|--------------|
| Development DB not running | Start PostgreSQL container | `make db-up` |
| Database connection errors | Check DB logs | `make db-logs` |
| Database needs migration | Run Alembic migrations | `make db-migrate` |
| Need to inspect database | Connect with psql | `make db-psql` |
| Stop development database | Stop PostgreSQL container | `make db-down` |

**Database Troubleshooting:**
```bash
# Check if database is running
docker ps | grep polytrader-postgres

# View database logs
make db-logs

# Connect and inspect
make db-psql
# Then: \dt (list tables), \d events (describe table), etc.
```

### Dependency & Environment Issues

| Situation | Action | Make Command |
|-----------|--------|--------------|
| Missing dependencies | Install production deps | `make install` |
| Missing dev tools | Install dev dependencies | `make install-dev` |
| Virtual environment not activated | Activate venv | `source venv/bin/activate` |
| Environment variables missing | Check `.env` file | See `environment.md` |

### Frontend / OpenAPI (API client)

| Situation | Action | Make Command |
|-----------|--------|--------------|
| `generate-api` fails / `openapi.json` not found | Dump spec from backend first | `make openapi-dump` (from repo root) |
| Regenerate client after backend API change | Dump spec, then generate | `make openapi-dump` then `make frontend-generate-api` or `cd polytrader-console && make generate-api` |
| Network error calling API (e.g. /api/v1/market/markets) | Backend runs on **port 8000** by default. Set `VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000` in `polytrader-console/.env` (not 8080). CORS is already `allow_origins=["*"]`. | Start backend: `python -m cli platform start` (or with `--config config/platform.paper.yaml`) |

### Build & CI Issues

| Situation | Action | Notes |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| CI failures on existing code | Note the failure, ask if known issue | Don't fix unrelated failures |
| Pre-merge validation | Run full check suite | `make lint && make type-check && make test` |
| Migration conflicts | Check Alembic version history | `alembic history` |

