## Common Error Messages & Solutions

### Python & Type Errors

| Error | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| `mypy` errors after editing | Add type hints; check `pyproject.toml` mypy config |
| `ruff` formatting changes | Run `make format` |
| Import errors | Check `PYTHONPATH`; ensure venv is activated |
| Module not found | Run `make install-dev` to install dependencies |

### Database Errors

| Error | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| `Connection refused` | Run `make db-up` to start PostgreSQL |
| `relation does not exist` | Run `make db-migrate` to create tables |
| `database does not exist` | Check `.env` DB_DATABASE matches docker-compose |
| Migration conflicts | Check `alembic/versions/` for conflicts; may need to resolve manually |

### Trading System Errors

| Error | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| `execution_enabled = false` | Check health gates; verify market data freshness |
| `RiskCheckEvent` denied | Review risk limits and reason codes in logs |
| `ReconcileEvent` divergence | Check venue vs internal state; may require manual intervention |
| `CircuitBreakerEvent` triggered | Review circuit breaker logs; system disabled for safety |

