## Debugging Workflow (Recommended)

### 1. Reproduce the Issue
```bash
# Ensure clean state
make db-up
make db-migrate
make test  # Verify baseline
```

### 2. Isolate the Problem
- Check logs for correlation_ids
- Review event store for recent events
- Verify database state vs projections

### 3. Fix & Verify
```bash
# Make changes
make format
make lint
make type-check
make test
```

### 4. Integration Check
```bash
# For integration changes
make test-integration
```

