## Quick Reference: All Make Commands

```bash
# Dependencies
make install          # Install production dependencies
make install-dev      # Install dev dependencies (includes production)

# Code Quality
make lint             # Run ruff linting
make format           # Auto-format with ruff
make type-check       # Run mypy type checking

# Testing
make test             # Run unit tests (parallel)
make test-integration # Run integration tests (parallel)

# Development Database
make db-up            # Start PostgreSQL container
make db-down          # Stop PostgreSQL container
make db-migrate       # Run Alembic migrations
make db-logs          # View database logs
make db-psql          # Connect to database with psql

# Test Database
make test-db-up       # Start test PostgreSQL container
make test-db-down     # Stop test PostgreSQL container
make test-db-migrate  # Run migrations on test database
```

